  "subtitle": "Your media library, now with Netflix-style streaming.",
  "description": "Nuvio is a free, open-source media app: bring your own sources and it turns them into a library with artwork, ratings, subtitles and your place saved on every screen.\n\nThis source carries an enhanced Nuvio build focused on smooth playback: quality adapts to your connection the way Netflix does, without reloads or loading screens.",
